hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"84","[AI-translation] Hazrat Tamim Dari (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, kafir mard ke bare mein kya sunnat [hukm] hai jo musalman ke hathon Islam laye? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Wo us ki zindagi aur us ki maut mein us ka sab se zyada haqdar hai.' Abdul Aziz bin Umar ne kaha: Aur main ne Umar bin Abdul Aziz (Rahimahullah) ko dekha ke unhon ne [isi] hukm se faisla kiya ek shakhs ke bare mein jo ek mard ke hathon Islam laya, phir wo faut ho gaya aur maal aur ek beti chhodi. To Umar ne us ki beti ko aadha diya, aur us [shakhs] ko jis ke hathon wo Islam laya tha [baqi] aadha."
